   125	/**
   126	 * Canonical live binding rule for both receipt import and REVIEW consumption.
   127	 * Material/story-file freshness remains the Proof Admissibility predicate, but
   128	 * a same-material HEAD move is rejected unless every intervening commit is an
   129	 * exact managed-review importer metadata commit.
